					//For other setting refer OP manual Ch 4.9
					39 00 00 40 00 00 06 F0 55 AA 52 08 01
					39 00 00 40 00 00 02 6F 03
					39 00 00 40 00 00 02 C5 00
					39 00 00 40 00 00 02 6F 04
					39 00 00 00 00 00 04 C5 25 25 25

